# 9. Real-World Examples

### Checkbox

```text id="m7v3p1"
☑ Pizza
☑ Burger
☐ Pasta
```

Multiple choices are possible.

### Radio

```text id="s6n2ka"
● Cash
○ UPI
○ Card
```

Only one payment method.

### Switch

```text id="g4d9xp"
Dark Mode       [ ON ]
```

Turns a setting on or off.

---

# 10. Important Pattern

All three generally follow the same idea:

```text id="b6q0hy"
Current value
      ↓
Widget displays value
      ↓
User interacts
      ↓
onChanged()
      ↓
setState()
      ↓
Value changes
      ↓
UI rebuilds
```

Example:

```dart id="j8n1cw"
bool isEnabled = false;

Switch(
  value: isEnabled,

  onChanged: (value) {

    setState(() {
      isEnabled = value;
    });

  },
)
```

